# Stack: frontend React

Package choices only. Layout, seams, and craft live in `frontend-core` / `frontend-testing` / `code-craft`. Attach this file with the React preset. Do not load it on backend-only projects.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| Bundler / app shell | Vite | |
| UI | React | |
| Styling | Tailwind | Utility-first; do not add a second CSS framework |
| Lint / format (greenfield) | Biome | One toolchain. Keep eslint (+ Prettier) only if the repo already uses it — do not run both |
| Unit tests | Vitest + React Testing Library | Jest + RTL only for non-Vite or legacy Jest apps |
| E2E / L1 | Playwright | See `frontend-testing` |
| Client router | Whatever the app already has (React Router or TanStack Router) | Do not invent a second URL state store |

Remote-state and schema libraries: `stack-frontend-http.mdc` when the app calls an HTTP API. WASM toolchain: `stack-frontend-wasm.mdc`.
